# Backend API URL. Must be https:// (not http://) — the dev server and
# backend both run over HTTPS using a self-signed cert (key.pem/cert.pem
# in the project root), which is required for microphone access
# (getUserMedia) to work on any address other than localhost — e.g. when
# testing from your phone via your PC's LAN IP.
# If key.pem/cert.pem don't exist yet, generate them (see README) before
# starting the dev server.
VITE_API_URL=https://localhost:8000